@startuml
[*] --> TaskSubmission
TaskSubmission --> TaskValidation : Submit Task
TaskValidation --> ErrorHandling : Invalid Task
TaskValidation --> TaskAssignment : Valid Task
TaskAssignment --> FeedbackGeneration : Assign Task
FeedbackGeneration --> TaskCompletion : Provide Feedback
TaskCompletion --> [*] : Complete Task
FeedbackGeneration --> TaskSubmission : Update or Cancel
TaskSubmission --> [*] : Cancel Task
ErrorHandling --> [*] : Handle Error
@enduml
